agent-tui frame 80x25
| ≡   ▽  1 #deploy   ♦  2 #infra    +                            ◆  #open   ⋯all |
|┌keys · ↑↓ scroll · any other key closes───────────────────────────────────────┐|
|│F1                 keys                                                       │|
|│Enter              send                                                       │|
|│Tab                complete                                                   │|
|│S-Tab              or ↑ at the top leaves the box                             │|
|│← →                move the cursor; outside the box, the element before or nex│|
|│↑ ↓                between the box's lines; outside it, a column row or a feed│|
|│Esc                clears the selection and the bar; outside the box, back to │|
|│PgUp PgDn          scroll the feed                                            │|
|│S-Enter M-Enter    new line                                                   │|
|│Home End Bksp Del  edit in the box; Home and End jump in lists                │|
|│click a message    selects it; a chip completes; the compose box: the cursor  │|
|│F3                 show or hide the agents and channels column                │|
|│Alt+0-9            tab (again: menu)                                          │|
|│F2                 tabs                                                       │|
|│Ctrl+T             the tab bar, as F2: ← → move, Enter its menu, Esc back     │|
|│Ctrl+N             new channel, from the compose box or the tab bar           │|
|│right-click        a tab, a row or a sender's name: its menu at once          │|
|│M-m                mouse on or off (off lets the terminal select text)        │|
|│Shift-drag         selects text while the mouse is on, in most terminals      │|
|│middle-click       pastes only while the mouse is off                         │|
|│^C                 quit; q asks first, ^C over a draft; so does ≡ → Quit      │|
|└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘|
| chat  mouse on (M-m) │ F1 keys · Enter send · Tab complete · S-Tab or ↑ leaves |
